ELEGANT 800mm Frameless Walk-In Shower Enclosure with 8mm Glass and Dual Shelves Silver


Upgrade your bathroom with the ELEGANT Frameless Walk-In Shower Enclosure.&amp;nbsp;
Featuring a seamless frameless design that maximises visual space and creates an open, luxurious ambience. Crafted from 8mm tempered safety glass, it ensures optimal light transmission while delivering superior shatter resistance for enhanced safety. Premium zinc alloy wall channels and corrosion-resistant stainless steel stabilisers provide robust structural integrity for lasting durability. The integrated dual-layer 8mm glass shelving, with a 10kg load capacity, offers practical storage for bath essentials, secured by stainless steel clamps with smooth, snag-free edges. The adjustable stabilisers accommodate ±15mm wall variations for precise fitting. Its modular configuration adapts seamlessly to future bathroom layouts, making it an ideal long-term investment for discerning homeowners seeking both style and functionality.

